Update Mechanism: Manual
Security Critical: no
Shipped: yes

Description:
@puppeteer/replay is a Node library which provides a high-level API to replay Chrome DevTools recordings.

To update this package, run:

```bash
python3 scripts/deps/roll_front_end_third_party.py @puppeteer/replay puppeteer-replay lib
```

Local Modifications:

- `package/lib/main.d.ts`: the `puppeteer` import points at the vendored copy in
  `front_end/third_party/puppeteer`. The `lighthouse` import is replaced with a
  local `any` stub because `front_end` does not use `LighthouseRunnerExtension`,
  the only API that references `lighthouse` types. The roll script applies both
  changes.